{# src/_includes/content/testimonials.njk — conteúdo da página de depoimentos, parametrizado por t/lang #}
{% from "macros.njk" import testimonialFullCard %}
{% set p = t.testimonials %}

<!-- ========== HERO ========== -->
<section class="test-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="test-hero__tag">{{ p.hero.tag }}</div>
        <h1>{{ p.hero.title }}</h1>
        <p>{{ p.hero.subtitle }}</p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== FILTERS ========== -->
<section class="test-filters">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="test-filters__list" role="group" aria-label="Filter testimonials by profile">
            <button class="test-filter active" data-filter="all">{{ p.filters.all }}</button>
            <button class="test-filter" data-filter="masters">{{ p.filters.masters }}</button>
            <button class="test-filter" data-filter="doctoral">{{ p.filters.doctoral }}</button>
            <button class="test-filter" data-filter="faculty">{{ p.filters.faculty }}</button>
            <button class="test-filter" data-filter="researcher">{{ p.filters.researcher }}</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== TESTIMONIALS GRID ========== -->
<section class="test-grid-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="test-grid" id="testGrid">
            {% for item in testimonials %}
                {{ testimonialFullCard(item, lang) }}
            {% endfor %}
        </div>

        <p class="test-empty" id="testEmpty" style="display:none;">{{ p.emptyMessage }}</p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== CTA ========== -->
<section class="test-cta">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>{{ p.cta.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ p.cta.body }}</p>
        <a href="{{ t.urlPrefix }}/technical-review" class="btn-primary">{{ p.cta.button }}</a>
    </div>
</section>
